{'symbol': 'SIVB', 'date': '2022-09-14 16:10:00', 'title': 'SVB FINANCIAL GROUP APPOINTS THOMAS KING TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS', 'text': 'SANTA CLARA, CALIF. , SEPT. 14, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- SVB FINANCIAL GROUP (SVB), THE FINANCIAL PARTNER OF THE INNOVATION ECONOMY AND PARENT OF SILICON VALLEY BANK, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE APPOINTMENT OF THOMAS KING, FORMER CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER OF INVESTMENT BANKING AT BARCLAYS, TO ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS, EFFECTIVE SEPTEMBER 13, 2022.'}